{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人梁祖堯最近偕盧鎮業（小野）、王菀之及谷祖琳等演出舞台劇《寫不得你》，昨日（30號）他在劇場度過生日，謝幕時拍檔湯駿業捧出蛋糕，並率領全場觀眾大合唱生日歌，台上的小野及王菀之亦拍手和唱，壽星仔驚訝掩嘴，氣氛感動又溫馨！</p><p>騷後梁祖堯在社交網分</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.927544+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T10:01:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_hash":"efe478e5a37ee33f6b19da6fa3e7dcbb8fe2ec7c3f2b7286b7cc55b573183e32","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}